an&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;•&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot; class=&quot;Apple-tab-span&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;只有&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;單一價格條件&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;作為觸發（上破/下破指定價位）。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; text-align: start;&quot; class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot; class=&quot;Apple-tab-span&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;•&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot; class=&quot;Apple-tab-span&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;允許有&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;慢變、不易抖動&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;的前置 gate 條件（日期、時段、日級/週級技術面、鏈上統計等）。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; text-align: start;&quot; class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot; class=&quot;Apple-tab-span&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;•&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot; class=&quot;Apple-tab-span&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;不可使用&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;快變/易抖動&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;條件（分鐘級指標、即時成交量、spread、深度、跨市價差等）。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: nor